# Keeper — copy to .env
#
# ONE required value.

# A burner wallet that ONLY pays gas. Fund it with ~0.1 Sepolia ETH.
# Do NOT reuse the deployer key: the deployer owns the contract, so a leak there
# would expose setEpochParams / setAuditor / sweepDust. A keeper key can do
# nothing except pay for settlement transactions anyone is allowed to send.
KEEPER_PRIVATE_KEY=
